        "id": 1002609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-16T18:53:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "agreed.\n\nDo you know what it means to be APPSTATE_UNKNOWN?  If that means we\u0027re still reading it clearly falls into NOT_READY.  Do we eventually pop out into READY or ERROR?  I don\u0027t think we want State.NOT_READY to be a permanent end-state.",
      "parentUuid": "754f32f9_c596fac7",
      "range": {
